{"id":"b6e1e6ddc034332a","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-mantle-class.md","title":"ZFC Mantle Class","display":"df-zfc-mantle-class — ZFC Mantle Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-mantle-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-mantle-class"],"display":"df-zfc-mantle-class — ZFC Mantle Class","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-mantle-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-mantle-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-mantle-class — ZFC Mantle Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb M,U\">\\(\\mathbb M,U\\)</span> are class variables and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> is the definable-class predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\)</span> is the ground relation (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MantleClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2\">\\(\\mathrm{MantleClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mantle\\text{-}class} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{MantleClass}_S(\\mathbb M,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\mathbb M)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(U)\\land\n\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathbb M\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in U\\land\\forall W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)\\to x\\in W)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mantle\\text{-}class} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{MantleClass}_S(\\mathbb M,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\mathbb M)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(U)\\land\n\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathbb M\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in U\\land\\forall W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)\\to x\\in W)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The intersection of a proper-class family is expressed elementwise and the ambient universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb M,U$ are class variables and $\\mathrm{Class}_S$ is the definable-class predicate (see [[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S$ is the ground relation (see [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb M,U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MantleClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mantle\\text{-}class} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{MantleClass}_S(\\mathbb M,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\mathbb M)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(U)\\land\n\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathbb M\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in U\\land\\forall W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)\\to x\\in W)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":1056,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2506","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-mantle-class.md|58-df-zfc-mantle-class]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["ca2a9c9166fa8cce","d0244462250ae67e"]}